          "id": "c8fd5d2a09e99834e732f94a63e2b527f880a010",
          "message": "(sq-9m3rn) [HAIKU-4.5] sparq-kb: add golden/byte-pin test for PipelineOutput::turtle (#1554)\n\nEnforce byte-for-byte compatibility of the literature pipeline's Turtle output.\nThe #1540 refactor's \"byte-for-byte unchanged\" claim is now verified by test,\nnot inspection. Future emission refactors must be conscious choices.\n\nThe test uses a committed golden file (tests/golden/openalex-fixture-combined.ttl)\nto pin the standard fixture pipeline's output. Drifts are caught loudly with a\nclear error message showing how to deliberately regenerate the golden file.\n\nMutation testing: verified that adding a single space to an emit format string\ncauses the test to fail, confirming it's not vacuous.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
          "timestamp": "2026-07-05T09:47:17Z",
